  "weixin_html": "<section data-side-margin=\"0\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background-color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#1f2937;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/xm1dT1jCe8lIO3P2oFVtd1x040PKGCRPN033gUTrHQQz0Licdqug5X1QgUPQBRCicoTqdYMrpgk7etibXLkK9rwcg/0?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" alt=\"关注提示\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:24px 0 8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff8f1 0%,#ffffff 100%);\"><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0 16px 20px;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#f97316;letter-spacing:0.08em;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;\">Daily Model Hub</p><h1 style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.4;color:#111827;font-weight:800;\">每日精选HuggingFace热门模型</h1><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;\">2026-07-10 · Hugging Face 热门模型速览</p></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#1 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-10/01-tencent-hy3.png\" alt=\"tencent/Hy3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">tencent/Hy3</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Hy3是由腾讯推出的模型，旨在提供高效的序列处理能力。该模型主要面向特定领域的任务，通过优化的架构设计，在处理长文本或复杂序列任务时展现出良好的性能。开发者和研究人员可将其应用于各种自然语言处理场景，利用其提供的中文和英文双语支持，提升文本理解与生成的效率。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#2 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-10/02-empero-ai-qwythos-9b-claude-mythos-5-1m-gguf.png\" alt=\"empero-ai/Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M-GGUF\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">empero-ai/Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M-GGUF</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M是一款基于9B参数规模的预训练语言模型，经过特定微调以提升叙事和逻辑推理能力。该模型支持长上下文窗口，能够处理大规模的输入数据，适用于角色扮演、创意写作以及需要长篇幅记忆的复杂交互任务，通过GGUF量化格式，方便用户在资源受限的环境下本地部署并高效运行。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-10/03-zai-org-glm-5-2.png\" alt=\"zai-org/GLM-5.2\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">zai-org/GLM-5.2</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">GLM-5.2是Z.ai组织开发的最新一代大规模预训练语言模型。该模型在GLM架构基础上进行了改进，具备更强的逻辑推理、复杂指令理解及多任务处理能力。用户可以通过官方API平台调用服务，或直接使用在线聊天界面。该模型适用于各类企业级应用、智能助手构建以及需要高标准自然语言处理性能的复杂业务场景。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-10/04-internscience-agents-a1.png\" alt=\"InternScience/Agents-A1\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">InternScience/Agents-A1</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Agents-A1是由InternScience推出的智能体模型，参数规模为35B。该模型通过创新的算法路径，实现了媲美万亿级参数模型的性能表现。其核心定位在于提升智能体在动态环境中的规划、决策与执行能力，适用于需要复杂自主代理协作的科研与工程应用，是追求高效能、轻量化大型模型部署的理想选择。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-10/05-baidu-unlimited-ocr.png\" alt=\"baidu/Unlimited-OCR\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">baidu/Unlimited-OCR</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Unlimited-OCR是百度推出的一款专注于光学字符识别技术的模型。该模型具备极高的文字识别精度和场景泛化能力，能够高效处理复杂文档、手写体以及各类复杂场景下的文字信息。作为OCR领域的技术工具，它主要用于文档数字化、信息提取及自动化办公场景，旨在解决多语言、多形态文字在复杂背景下的精准还原问题。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qHfXxy1p